[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1141.549, "timestamp": "00:19:01", "text": "離れて。だから私はミュートし続けなければならなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1143.15, "timestamp": "00:19:03", "text": "自分。ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1145.87, "timestamp": "00:19:05", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1153.59, "timestamp": "00:19:13", "text": "神。はい、３つ手に入れました。あなたはそうすべきだった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1157.19, "timestamp": "00:19:17", "text": "彼女が私たちに紹介してくれた。私は怖いです。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1161.669, "timestamp": "00:19:21", "text": "彼女が私の名前のように行ってしまうのが怖い。もし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1168.83, "timestamp": "00:19:28", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1172.15, "timestamp": "00:19:32", "text": "正気じゃない。彼女はそれについてはあまり知らない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1173.87, "timestamp": "00:19:33", "text": "もの。私はしないだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1176.789, "timestamp": "00:19:36", "text": "それ。つまり、私はそれを行うつもりです。しかし"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1177.091, "timestamp": "00:19:37", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "does she call u by yr irl name or some nickname?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1179.59, "timestamp": "00:19:39", "text": "いつか、でもいつか私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1180.75, "timestamp": "00:19:40", "text": "日本、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1182.325, "timestamp": "00:19:42", "author": "@RPGfanatic-i3z", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/F9kA73IKR7TCeh1WUg7fNOkjcUJ6lPk8I6j69xenF_vJcjZ4GCnCIeYo88hJF8jUU3OAOsYG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hi joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1183.789, "timestamp": "00:19:43", "text": "だから、その日は来ないだろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1187.789, "timestamp": "00:19:47", "text": "うん、それが良いことかどうかはわからない"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1190.764, "timestamp": "00:19:50", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"thank u for giving me separate room in separate corner of the house. i sleep at 4 am here.\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1190.87, "timestamp": "00:19:50", "text": "アイデア。つまり、私は他のユーチューバーを知っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1194.63, "timestamp": "00:19:54", "text": "やったよ。 「はい、大丈夫です」としか言えません。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1195.905, "timestamp": "00:19:55", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@NINJA, Joq's Concert Plate he wont introduce us, he's ashamed of us :("}]